        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, we realize a pricing upgrade when selling the remaining NGLs product stream at current prices.",
        "start_character": 34473,
        "end_character": 34576
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-013386",
